OL,3,AGermany says Russia behind Leipzig
OL,4,Aairport drone attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FGermany has said Russia was responsible
OL,7,Ffor last month's drone attack at
OL,8,FLeipzig's airport.
OL,10,FA drone carrying an explosive device
OL,11,Fwas discovered at Leipzig/Halle Airport
OL,12,Fin eastern Germany, close to Ukrainian
OL,13,Fcargo planes, on 4 August.
OL,15,FIt failed to explode as the detonator
OL,16,Fwas apparently faulty, and
OL,17,Finvestigators suspect a second drone
OL,18,Fcollided with a cargo aircraft nearby.
OL,19,FA third drone was reportedly found near
OL,20,Fthe airport 10 days later.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
