OL,3,AGermany says Russia behind Leipzig
OL,4,Aairport drone attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterior Minister Alexander Dobrindt
OL,7,Fsaid the Leipzig airport attack
OL,8,Ffollowed the "well-established pattern
OL,9,Fof Russian hybrid operations in Europe"
OL,10,Fand the assumption was that Germany
OL,11,Fwould be targeted again.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
